<title>THAILAND: National Petrochemical 1996 net rises. [CORRECTED 10:46 GMT]</title>
<headline>National Petrochemical 1996 net rises. [CORRECTED 10:46 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		1.88	vs	     1.35</p>
<p>    Net		     583.64	vs	   419.83</p>
<p>(Thai Stock Exchange corrects Net profit for 1996 from 646.23 to 583.64 million baht and for 1995 from 421.12 to 419.83 million baht.)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is National Petrochemical Plc, a petrochemical firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
